@startuml
title D-05 Payment Finality to Fiscal Issuance to ExitAuthorization Sequence
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam wrapWidth 220

participant "Payment Orchestrator" as POA
participant "Central PMS" as Central
participant "Resolved Site POS Server" as POS
participant "Gate / Exit Consumer" as Gate
participant "Vendor PMS Connector" as Connector
participant "Reconciliation / Audit" as Recon

POA -> Central : report verified provider outcome
Central -> Central : accept outcome and record platform payment finality
Central -> Recon : emit payment finality fact

Central -> POS : request fiscal issuance for resolved Site
alt fiscal issuance succeeds
  POS --> Central : Sales Invoice identity and fiscal status
  Central -> Central : record fiscal issuance reference
  Central -> Recon : emit fiscal reference fact
  Central -> Central : evaluate ExitAuthorization eligibility
  Central -> Gate : issue Central PMS ExitAuthorization
  Gate --> Central : consume authorization / report outcome
  Central -> Connector : acknowledge paid or eligible state where applicable
  Connector --> Central : acknowledgment result or pending status
  Central -> Recon : emit gate and vendor acknowledgment facts
else fiscal issuance fails or times out
  POS --> Central : failure / timeout status
  Central -> Recon : open fiscal exception
  Central -> Central : block normal ExitAuthorization
end

note right of POS
POS Server is fiscal authority only.
It does not declare payment finality or issue ExitAuthorization.
end note

note over Central
Fiscal exception release, if any, requires
separately approved policy and reconciliation tags.
end note
@enduml
